  "description": "The emotion expressed is a malicious, mocking glee derived from the juxtaposition of the horrific historical trauma of the transatlantic slave trade with the commercial promotion of Black Friday. The text 'black friday sale' is used to trivialize and commodify human suffering, expressing a hateful and exploitative form of joy that derives satisfaction from inflicting pain on a marginalized group through racialized commerce.",
